=== Erudites ===

''Can make Steelsilk Armor (tailored with smithing components). Use a [[Erud Forge]] for the smithing, and a [[Erudite Sewing Kit]] for the tailoring.''

See [[Cultural Tradeskills: Erudite]] for complete recipe list.

=== Halflings ===

''Can make Vale Leather Armor (tailored with smithing components). Use a [[Vale Forge]] for the smithing, and a [[Vale Sewing Kit]] for the tailoring.''

See [[Cultural Tradeskills: Halfling]] for complete recipe list.

=== Wood Elves ===

''Can make Mithril Armor (tailored with smithing components). Use a [[Forge|Feir`dal Forge]] for the smithing, and a [[Feir'Dal Sewing Kit]] for the tailoring.''

See [[Cultural Tradeskills: Wood Elf]] for complete recipe list.

